```c
struct node* traverse_list() {
    struct node* curr = head;
    while (curr) {
        hp[thread_id] = curr;
        // BUG: Fails to check if curr was deleted 
        // before the hazard pointer was registered!
        curr = curr->next; 
    }
}
```

fix:
Re-verify the node's validity immediately after registering the hazard pointer.
```c
struct node* curr = head;
while (curr) {
    hp[thread_id] = curr;
    if (head != curr) { // Double check validity
        curr = head; // Restart traversal
        continue;
    }
    curr = curr->next;
}
```
